hadiths[27]{hadithnumber,text}:
"417","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Ja'dah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah tashreef lae to Aap ne logon ko ghar taqseem farmaye. To Banu Zuhrah ka ek qabila jinhen Banu Abd bin Zuhrah kaha jata hai ne kaha: Ham se Ibn Umm Abd [Abdullah bin Mas'ud] ko door karo. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'To phir Allah Azz wa Jall ne mujhe kyun bheja? Beshak Allah Azz wa Jall us ummat ko pak nahin farmata jis mein kamzor ka haq us ke liye na liya jae.'"
"418","[AI-translation] Urwah bin Zubair (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zubair ko zameen [iqta ke taur par] ata farmai; aur Umar ne Aqiq sara [ata farmaya]."
"419","[AI-translation] Alqamah bin Nazlah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Sufyan bin Harb ne apne ghar ke darwaze par apna paon mara aur kaha: Zameen ki kohan; beshak us ki kohan hai. Ibn Farqad Sulami ka gumaan hai ke main apna haq us ke haq se nahin pehchanta: Mere liye Marwah ka siyah hissa, us ke liye us ka safed hissa, ya mere liye Marwah ka safed hissa, us ke liye us ka siyah hissa; shak Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) se hai. Aur mere liye jo mere in dono qadmon ke darmiyan se Tujna tak hai. To yeh Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) tak pahuncha; unhon ne kaha: 'Us ne jhoot kaha; kisi ke liye nahin siwae us ke jise us ki deewaren gheren.' Abu Ja'far Tahawi ne ham se kaha: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Jab shuf'ah wala jan le to us ke liye shuf'ah mangne ki zyada se zyada teen din ijazat hai; jab teen din se aage badh jae to us ka mangna jaiz nahin. Aur yeh meri taraf se istehsan hai, asl [hadees] nahin."
"420","[AI-translation] Urwah bin Zubair (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hadi ke zimmedar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hadi mein se jo [raste mein beemar ya zakhmi ho kar] rah jae us ke sath main kya karun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: 'Use zibah karo, phir us ke haar ko us ke khoon mein rang do, phir logon aur us ke darmiyan chhor do; woh use khayen.'"
"421","[AI-translation] Urwah (Rahimahullah) se Najiyah, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke oonton ke zimmedar (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, oonton mein se jo [raste mein beemar ho kar] rah jae us ke sath main kya karun? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Use zibah karo, phir us ke haar ko us ke khoon mein rang do, phir us se us ke pahlun par maro, phir us ke aur logon ke darmiyan chhor do.'"
"422","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne atharah oont ek aadmi ke sath bheje; Aap ne use un ke bare mein Apna hukm diya. Woh gaya phir Aap ke paas wapas aaya aur kaha: Bataiye agar un mein se koi [beemar ho kar] langdane lage? Aap ne farmaya: 'To use zibah karo, phir us ke joote [haar] ko us ke khoon mein rang do, phir use us ke pahlun par rakho [nishan ke taur par]; tum us mein se na khao aur na tumhare sathiyon mein se koi.'"
"423","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jab jamrah ko kankariyan marin aur apni qurbani zibah ki to hajjam ko apna dayan hissa diya aur us ne use munda. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Talhah ko [baal] diye. Phir Aap ne hajjam ko apna baen hissa diya aur us ne use munda. Phir 'Aap ne Abu Talhah ko hukm diya ke use logon mein taqseem kare.'"
"424","[AI-translation] Rifa'ah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pukara: 'Ai logo, beshak Quraish amanat wale [ek qiraat ke mutabiq; sahih: Imamat wale] hain; jo un se girane [unhen zaleel karne] ka mutaliba kare, Allah use us ki naak ke bal giraega'; Aap ne use teen martaba farmaya. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Muzani ne ham ko aise hi padh kar sunaya 'amanat wale'; jabke woh imamat wale hain. Aur unhon ne kaha: 'Awafir'; jabke woh 'Awathir [giravat aur zillat] hain."
"425","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Haris Taimi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Qatadah bin Nu'man ne Quraish ki burai ki goya unhon ne unhen halka samjha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tehro Ai Qatadah; Quraish ko bura na kaho. Beshak ho sakta hai tum un mein se mard dekho, ya un mein se mard aayen jin ke amal ke sath tum apne amal ko haqeer jano, un ke kirdar ke sath apne kirdar ko; tum unhen jab dekho ge to unhen azeem janoge. Agar Quraish sarkash na hote to main unhen batata jo un ke liye Allah Azz wa Jall ke paas hai [fazilat mein se].'"
"426","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se us sanad ke sath jise Muhammad bin Idris Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) yaad nahin rakhte, Aap ne Quraish ke bare mein khabar mein se kuch farmaya jise bhi Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) yaad nahin rakhte; us mein se jo mujhe yaad raha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Quraish ke behtar logon mein se behtareen hain; Quraish ke bure bure logon mein se behtar hain.'"
"427","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum logon ko khadanon [mukhtalif dhaton] ki tarah paoge; un mein se Jahiliyat mein behtar Islam mein behtar hain jab deen samjhen.'"
"428","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tumhare paas Yaman wale aae hain; woh sab se narm dil aur sab se raqeeq dil wale hain. Iman Yaman hai, hikmat Yamani hai.'"
"429","[AI-translation] Hasan bin Qasim Azraqi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Tabuk ki ghati par khade hue aur farmaya: 'Jo yahan hai Shaam hai'; Aap ne apne hath se Shaam ki taraf ishara farmaya. 'Aur jo yahan hai Yaman hai'; Aap ne apne hath se Madinah ki taraf ishara farmaya."
"430","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Tufail bin Amr Dausi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak Daus ne na-farmani ki aur inkar kiya; Allah se us par dua farmayen. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qible ki taraf munh farmaya aur apne dono hath uthae. To logon ne kaha: Daus halaak hui. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Ai Allah, Daus ko hidayat de aur unhen le aa. Ai Allah, Daus ko hidayat de aur unhen le aa.'"
"431","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar hijrat na hoti to main Ansar mein se ek aadmi hota; agar log kisi wadi ya ghati mein chalen to main Ansar ki wadi ya un ki ghati mein chalunga.'"
"432","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne marz mein nikle aur khutba diya; Aap ne Allah ki hamd aur sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: 'Beshak Ansar ne jo un par tha ada kar diya, baqi raha jo tum par hai; un ke nekokar se qabool karo, un ke badkar se darguzar karo.'"
"433","[AI-translation] Hasan [Basri] (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: '[Ansar se us mein darguzar karo] jis mein hadd na ho.'"
"434","[AI-translation] Jurjani ne apni hadees mein kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ai Allah, Ansar, Ansar ke beton, aur Ansar ke beton ke beton ko bakhsh de.'"
"435","[AI-translation] Unhon ne apni hadees mein kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab nikle to Ansar ki aurten aur bachche Aap ki taraf khush hokar [isteqbal ke liye] rote hue [aaye]; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un par narm hue, phir khutba diya aur yeh kalima farmaya."
"436","[AI-translation] Ba'z ahle ilm se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Main ne apne liye aur Ansar ke is qabile ke liye misal nahin pai siwae us ke jo Tufail Ghanawi ne kaha: Allah hamari taraf se Ja'far ko jaza de jab hamari jotiyon ne ham ko raundne walon mein buland kiya aur phisal gayin. Unhon ne ham se uktane se inkar kiya; agar hamari man milti jo woh ham mein pate hain to woh ukta jati. Wahi hain jinhon ne ham ko janon se milaya, kamron mein jagah di jo garm aur saya dar the.' Tahawi ne ham se kaha: Jab Muzani ne mujhe yeh hadees bayan ki to mere walid (Rahimahullah) ne un se kaha: Beshak sher ke ahle ilm is qaseede mein do aur sher badhate hain jo is ma'na mein dakhil hain; unhon ne kaha: Ghar ki taraf aao yahan tak ke wazeh ho aur andhera us se door ho jo door hua. Aur is ke ba'd ke ham Salma aur us ke ghar walon ke liye ghulam the, shehron ne ham se uktaya aur uktae gae. Ravi kehte hain: To Muzani ne in dono ko pasand farmaya kyunke yeh dono us ma'na mein dakhil hain jo gaya gaya."
"437","[AI-translation] Umm Habibah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein Jam [Muzdalifah] se Mina andhere mein sawere nikalte."
"438","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Muzdalifah mein Maghrib aur Isha ikatthi padhin; un mein se ek mein iqamat ke siwa azan nahin kahi gayi; un dono ke darmiyan aur un mein se ek ke ba'd tasbeeh [sunnat namaz] nahin padhi."
"439","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne hajjatul-wada mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Muzdalifah mein Maghrib aur Isha ikatthi padhin."
"440","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Muzdalifah mein Maghrib aur Isha ikatthi padhin."
"441","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne unhen kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Arafah se chale; jab raste [shi'b] mein the to utre aur peshab farmaya phir wuzu farmaya baghair mukammal kiye. To main ne Aap se kaha: Namaz [yahan]? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Namaz tumhare samne hai [Muzdalifah mein].' To Aap sawar hue; jab Muzdalifah tashreef lae to utre aur wuzu farmaya aur Apna wuzu mukammal farmaya. Phir namaz ki iqamat kahi gayi; Aap ne Maghrib padhai. Phir har insan ne apna oont apni jagah bithaya. Phir Isha ki iqamat kahi gayi; Aap ne use padha; un dono ke darmiyan kuch namaz nahin padhi."
"442","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Jam [Muzdalifah] mein Maghrib aur Isha ikatthi padhin."
"443","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne, Aap aur Aap ke sahaba ne, hajj ka ehram bandha; un mein se kisi ke paas hadi nahin thi siwae Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Talhah ke. Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) Yaman se aae un ke paas hadi thi. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne us ka ehram bandha jis ka Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ehram bandha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba ko hukm diya ke use umrah banayen: Tawaf karen phir baal katwayen aur halal hon, siwae jis ke paas hadi ho. To unhon ne kaha: Kya ham Mina is haal mein jayen ke ham mein se ek ka zakar tapak raha ho [ehlaal ke ba'd jima ki wajah se]? To yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahuncha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar main apne mamle mein se jo guzar chuka us ka istiqbal karta [agar mujhe pehle maloom hota], to hadi na lata; agar mere paas hadi na hoti to halal ho jata.' Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) haiza huin; unhon ne tamam manasik ada kiye siwae is ke ke unhon ne Baitullah ka tawaf nahin kiya. Jab pak huin aur [Mina ki taraf] rawan huin to kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya tum hajj aur umrah lekar jaoge jabke main hajj lekar jaun? To Aap ne Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr ko hukm diya ke un ke sath Tan'eem tak niklen; unhon ne hajj ke ba'd Zulhijjah mein umrah kiya. Suraqah bin Ju'shum Aqabah par Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mile jab Aap use kankariyan mar rahe the; unhon ne kaha: Kya yeh tumhare liye khaas hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin, balke hamesha ke liye [ummat ke liye].'"
